  "persona": "",
  "subject": "the ballad of A-kiat, a 23-year-old rookie at a rural Pingtung fire station whose calls are never fires: a hornet nest at the school gate, a cat stuck up a betel palm, then a two-metre cobra coiled on the uncle's leather shoes in an auntie's shoe cabinet, which he takes with tongs and a cloth sack and lets go at the foot of Mount Dawu, until the whole township calls him the Snake King",
  "caption": "Taiwanese Hokkien corridos tumbados in the modern Mexican sierreño style. A requinto guitar playing quick triplet runs and bent-note slides between the vocal lines; a twelve-string docerola strumming a tight, swung 6/8 rhythm; a tuba pumping the bass line on the downbeats; a soft shaker. Dry, close, live-in-the-room acoustic mix with the requinto up front. A laid-back male tenor with a slightly nasal, conversational swagger, telling the story straight-faced. 112 BPM, A minor. Swaggering, deadpan and proud of a small-town legend. No trap hi-hats, no 808 bass, no autotune, no rap verse, no norteño accordion, no pop ballad chorus.",
  "lyrics": "[Verse]\n屏東庄跤 一間細間的消防隊\n新來的阿傑 才二十三歲\n消防衫穿好 想講欲去救火\n電話一下響 是學校門口的虎頭蜂\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n第二通 貓仔佇檳榔樹頂 落袂來\n第三通 阿姨講 鞋櫥仔內有物件咧動\n\n[Chorus]\n掠蛇的 阿傑\n一枝夾仔 一跤布袋\n飯匙銃 頭攑懸懸\n伊的面色 攏無變\n\n[Verse]\n阿姨徛佇 椅頭仔頂\n手攑掃梳 喝甲規庄攏聽著\n阿傑慢慢仔 共鞋櫥仔拍開\n一尾兩公尺 捲佇阿伯的皮鞋頂\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n頷頸 若飯匙 一下展開\n阿姨 已經走到巷仔口\n\n[Chorus]\n掠蛇的 阿傑\n一枝夾仔 一跤布袋\n頷頸一下夾 尾溜一下收\n阿姨佇巷仔口 拍噗仔\n\n[Verse]\n伊共布袋 囥佇車斗\n載去大武山跤 放伊走\n這馬規庄 蛇也好 蜂也好\n電話一下響 攏講欲揣阿傑\n\n[Bridge]\n伊來兩冬 猶未救過一擺火\n伊講 按呢嘛好\n上好 一世人 攏無火\n\n[Chorus]\n掠蛇的 阿傑\n一枝夾仔 一跤布袋\n火 猶未救過半擺\n規庄 攏叫伊 蛇王\n\n[Outro]\n阿傑 閣出門矣",
